   "cooked": "<h1>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#tec-rewards-distribution-round-14-16-200622-to-290722-1\" name=\"tec-rewards-distribution-round-14-16-200622-to-290722-1\"></a>TEC Rewards Distribution - round-14-16  - 20/06/22 to 29/07/22</h1>\n<p>This period covers the 3 praise periods before the summer break, between <strong>20 June 2022 and 29 July 2022</strong>. We allocated <strong>5628</strong> TEC tokens for rewards, with a <strong>100:0</strong> split between Praise and Sourcecred. Some praise accounts still haven’t been activated so the total amount below will be less than what we set aside to distribute.</p>\n<p>Out of the total rewards:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>90% of the tokens were given as praise rewards <img alt=\":pray:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/pray.png?v=10\" title=\":pray:\"/>\n</li>\n<li>7% distributed among quantifiers <img alt=\":balance_scale:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/balance_scale.png?v=10\" title=\":balance_scale:\"/>\n</li>\n<li>3% assigned to the reward board <img alt=\":memo:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/memo.png?v=10\" title=\":memo:\"/>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This data has been reviewed by the Quantifiers and the Reward Board, and has been submitted for distribution to the <a href=\"https://xdai.aragon.blossom.software/#/rewardboardtec/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Reward Board DAO</a></p>\n<p>You can check out the period analysis for each distribution in the <a href=\"https://github.com/CommonsBuild/tec-rewards\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">tec-rewards repository</a>. <img alt=\":bar_chart:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/bar_chart.png?v=10\" title=\":bar_chart:\"/></p>\n<p>This post will be open to the community for review for 48 hours then submitted to the Reward Board for final execution. <img alt=\":heavy_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/heavy_check_mark.png?v=10\" title=\":heavy_check_mark:\"/></p>\n<p>The Rewards Distribution for this round is as follows:</p>\n<div class=\"md-table\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Username</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:right\">Rewards in TEC</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">natesuits#4789</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">296.044560784674</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">bear100#9085</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">232.397071148742</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Zeptimus#3359</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">222.485434074449</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">enti#1546</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">215.398249257587</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Nuggan#5183</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">211.962233755165</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">kristofer#1475</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">190.212586492625</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">divine_comedian#5493</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">182.263520219099</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">acidlazzer#5796</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">174.060750329534</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Tam2140#9361</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">171.306358080477</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">akrtws (TE Academy)<span class=\"hashtag\">#4246</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">169.13198203359</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">GideonRo#3175</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">163.036421783115</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">r-x-x#8344</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">150.198682840215</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">chuygarcia.eth#6692</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">140.262360015442</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">iviangita#3204</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">139.454756599378</td>\n</tr>